  "translation": "This weekend, my family of three went to a restaurant to eat. We set off from home and took the bus to the restaurant. There were many people there, and we found a seat by the window and sat down. The waiter first brought us the menu. I ordered a few dumplings. Mom ordered two cups of milk tea and also ordered half a cup of black tea. Dad asked me if I wanted to drink black tea or green tea. I said I also wanted to drink green tea. I did not order black tea. While we were waiting for the dishes, Dad looked at his phone. The food came right away. We ate happily. These dishes were the best! I asked Mom what this dish was, didn't know who ordered the black tea, and these dishes were so delicious. After eating, Dad went to pay. He used how much money? He used fifty yuan. Then we walked out of the restaurant. Outside, it was already late. We took the bus home, and on the way I looked at my phone. Today was too happy. I told Mom, next time we'll come here again to eat. I often come to this restaurant. I will come again. I can eat a lot inside. Dad said don't order too much. We eat together. I sit on the left, Mom sits on the right, there is a table in front, a window behind, a lamp above, and a floor below."
